{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55046","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入他国，我即论爲（辛本、川本作「其」）宾。\n若是他来攻我寨，我爲主（辛本、川本作「宾」）者汝爲宾（辛本、川本作「尊」），此理合天文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}